{"4229480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Manager", "steam_appid": 4229480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, launch and manage realistic space missions across our solar system, placing satellites and telescopes in precise orbits. Explore planets, collect valuable scientific data and sell your findings to expand your rising aerospace empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong>Space Manager today and join our incredible community on <strong>Discord </strong>to follow updates, forward feedback and much more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE A LAUNCHPAD TO THE STARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey by choosing the ideal spaceport site, each offering unique strategic advantages. Geography, weather, and regional bonuses shape the efficiency and cost of your early launches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/51d1c0c1b8bd35518122327841ccc3b7.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/51d1c0c1b8bd35518122327841ccc3b7.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/51d1c0c1b8bd35518122327841ccc3b7.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD A FLEET OF SPACECRAFTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and configure systems and platforms by selecting from a variety of  rockets, satellites, fuel types, and components aligned with mission goals. Manage trade-offs between performance, reliability, and budget as your launch operations grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/595882359d2768ef70ef6e2592c079f3.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/595882359d2768ef70ef6e2592c079f3.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/595882359d2768ef70ef6e2592c079f3.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER COSMIC NAVIGATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the physics of spaceflight by plotting orbital paths, planning trajectories, and executing precise missions. Every launch demands careful calculation, skillful piloting, and adaptive decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/a5252cd1c14a30d5d30088543cec9d7f.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/a5252cd1c14a30d5d30088543cec9d7f.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/a5252cd1c14a30d5d30088543cec9d7f.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE A NETWORK OF SATELLITES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy satellites into orbit for communication, imaging, research, or commercial contracts. Build constellations, expand networks, and generate steady revenue streams from orbital assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/b9578f7273fcccb8c3d58dc20727aee5.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/b9578f7273fcccb8c3d58dc20727aee5.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/b9578f7273fcccb8c3d58dc20727aee5.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE UNIVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push beyond Earth’s orbit to explore our solar system and beyond. Find new worlds, chart asteroid belts, and uncover cosmic phenomena awaiting scientific study and exploitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/d87fa68bbb9357416539f23e0ca95666.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/d87fa68bbb9357416539f23e0ca95666.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/d87fa68bbb9357416539f23e0ca95666.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN EXPLORATION INTO PROFIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn exploration into profit as your company becomes a leader in scientific breakthroughs. Sell data, license research, and secure government and private funding based on your findings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/e2c1fefe637bd28f4bd1c1d9d2351c90.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/e2c1fefe637bd28f4bd1c1d9d2351c90.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/e2c1fefe637bd28f4bd1c1d9d2351c90.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH NEW TECHNOLOGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in advanced technologies—from improved propulsion systems to deep-space scanners—to enhance your missions. Each breakthrough unlocks new gameplay possibilities and deeper exploration routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/25cba2472f7ea7b54a154ce5fcaf06a9.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/25cba2472f7ea7b54a154ce5fcaf06a9.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/25cba2472f7ea7b54a154ce5fcaf06a9.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DEEP SPACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your reach into uncharted space. Send probes to distant moons, establish outposts on new worlds, and continue pushing the boundaries of human knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/9f8124a9f5c8a41e22533d9ca615e1bb.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/9f8124a9f5c8a41e22533d9ca615e1bb.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/9f8124a9f5c8a41e22533d9ca615e1bb.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND WAYS TO GATHER DATA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scientific data from missions, satellites, and deep-space ventures. Analyze findings to fuel research, complete contracts, and increase your company’s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/bbe5bd350346865a3d25ad86b19b3500.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/bbe5bd350346865a3d25ad86b19b3500.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/bbe5bd350346865a3d25ad86b19b3500.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE BIGGEST AEROSPACE EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, outmaneuver competitors, and grow your company from a small startup into a galaxy-spanning aerospace titan. Your vision, strategy, and innovation will determine the future of space exploration. Learn from your failures and use them for success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/6125fc91689c606e37a1d359402921ba.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/6125fc91689c606e37a1d359402921ba.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/6125fc91689c606e37a1d359402921ba.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft rockets. Chart the stars. Conquer space—one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong>Space Manager today and join our incredible community on <strong>Discord </strong>to follow updates, forward feedback and much more.<br><br><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, launch and manage realistic space missions across our solar system, placing satellites and telescopes in precise orbits. Explore planets, collect valuable scientific data and sell your findings to expand your rising aerospace empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong>Space Manager today and join our incredible community on <strong>Discord </strong>to follow updates, forward feedback and much more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE A LAUNCHPAD TO THE STARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey by choosing the ideal spaceport site, each offering unique strategic advantages. Geography, weather, and regional bonuses shape the efficiency and cost of your early launches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/51d1c0c1b8bd35518122327841ccc3b7.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/51d1c0c1b8bd35518122327841ccc3b7.webm?t=178