team/apps/4229480/extras/25cba2472f7ea7b54a154ce5fcaf06a9.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DEEP SPACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your reach into uncharted space. Send probes to distant moons, establish outposts on new worlds, and continue pushing the boundaries of human knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/9f8124a9f5c8a41e22533d9ca615e1bb.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/9f8124a9f5c8a41e22533d9ca615e1bb.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/9f8124a9f5c8a41e22533d9ca615e1bb.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND WAYS TO GATHER DATA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scientific data from missions, satellites, and deep-space ventures. Analyze findings to fuel research, complete contracts, and increase your company’s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/bbe5bd350346865a3d25ad86b19b3500.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/bbe5bd350346865a3d25ad86b19b3500.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/bbe5bd350346865a3d25ad86b19b3500.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE THE BIGGEST AEROSPACE EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, outmaneuver competitors, and grow your company from a small startup into a galaxy-spanning aerospace titan. Your vision, strategy, and innovation will determine the future of space exploration. Learn from your failures and use them for success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/6125fc91689c606e37a1d359402921ba.poster.avif?t=1788265390\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/6125fc91689c606e37a1d359402921ba.webm?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/extras/6125fc91689c606e37a1d359402921ba.mp4?t=1788265390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft rockets. Chart the stars. Conquer space—one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong>Space Manager today and join our incredible community on <strong>Discord </strong>to follow updates, forward feedback and much more.<br><br><br><br></p>", "short_description": "Build, launch and manage realistic space missions across our solar system, placing satellites and telescopes in precise orbits. Explore planets, collect valuable scientific data and sell your findings to expand your rising aerospace empire.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/ff6f9d39e3bcd41497fc9afef31a2c6f8b0db87e/header.jpg?t=1788265390", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229480/9212ee36f69aaffaa94cb8aacfd2f345b6739672/capsule_231x87.jpg?